  itemName: Execute
  itemSpr: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f6c45bc645028634d8fe67f82251cd26, type: 3}
  itemDesc: 'A ceremonial technique performed by the followers of Death upon those
    that refuse it. The user must call a sorrowful prayer before they painlessly
    terminate their target. Of course, it is only painless for those that do not
    withstand it.

    

    Executions of the dead are often embraced by those
    who enjoy the course of their lives, but many find their feelings change when
    faced with their own end. It is only natural, after all.'
